</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/5ad390da-9579-11ec-9ad2-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Famille%20recompos%C3%A9e.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/5ad390da-9579-11ec-9ad2-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Famille%20recompos%C3%A9e.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">ce8486b8-8437-11f1-b793-131eff2948d7</guid><pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 12:37:43 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>艾娃</dc:creator></item><item><category>法国</category><title>法杀妻案遗体不再存谜团    遗骸是妻子德尔菲娜（Delphine）</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD/20260719-%E6%B3%95%E6%9D%80%E5%A6%BB%E6%A1%88%E9%81%97%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E5%AD%98%E8%B0%9C%E5%9B%A2-%E9%81%97%E9%AA%B8%E6%98%AF%E5%A6%BB%E5%AD%90%E5%BE%B7%E5%B0%94%E8%8F%B2%E5%A8%9C-delphine</link><description>
