</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/78520942-1160-11ea-ba64-005056a99247/w:1024/p:16x9/fa_guo_shi_jie_bao_wb161923-rfi-cn-20150123_cartouche.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/78520942-1160-11ea-ba64-005056a99247/w:1024/p:16x9/fa_guo_shi_jie_bao_wb161923-rfi-cn-20150123_cartouche.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">10846ae8-822f-11f1-8ed8-8fdd67fb21c5</guid><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 22:30:07 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>安东尼</dc:creator></item></channel></rss>
